---
from "@components/link.nexy" import Link
---
<section class="w-full w-container bg-background-second  md:border-x border-border border-dashed p-24 space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-medium">What's in Nexy ?</h2>
    <p class="text-base font-light max-w-xl leading-6">
        Nexy is a Python web framework optimized for building fast, content-driven
        websites, API services, and more.
    </p>
    <div  class="grid grid-cols-3 grid-rows-3  mt-16 *:h-48 *:bg-amber-50/20 *:border *:border-b-0 *:border-r-0 *:border-border/40 *:backdrop-blur  *:corner ">
            <div class="rounded-t-2xl border-r!">1</div>
            <div class=" border-0! bg-transparent!">2</div>
            <div class="rounded-t-2xl border-r!">3</div>
            <div class="">4</div>
            <div class="">5</div>
            <div class="border-r!">6</div>
            <div class="border-b! rounded-bl-2xl">7</div>
            <div class="">8</div>
            <div class="border-b! border-r! rounded-br-2xl ">9</div>
            <div class="col-start-2 rounded-b-2xl border-r! border-b!">10</div>
    </div>
</section>